                                "sense_id": "a411d2cf-e2e4-39f9-a648-c089a7036d1e",
                                "text": "Within a year or two of Galileo's telescopic discoveries no one disputed that the moon had mountains, Jupiter had moons, Venus had phases and the sun had spots […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4dba17ab-2343-3e16-94b5-bfd988a2e861",
